<title>POLAND: Polish Apator opens 87.5 pct above issue.</title>
<headline>Polish Apator opens 87.5 pct above issue.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish gauge maker Apator SA started trading on the parallel market of the Warsaw bourse at 37.5 zlotys, 87.5 percent higher than its January 1,400,015- share initial public offering price of 20 zlotys.</p>
<p>The offering was oversubscribed.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
